            "Notes: Prices evolution between 1 June 2025 and 26 June 2026. Crude oil refers to the average benchmark prices for Europe (Brent), Northern America (WTI), Middle East (Dubai) and Russia (Urals). The period highlighted as military escalation spans from 28 February 2026 to 14 June 2026, when an agreement, including the opening of the Strait, was announced."
        ],
        "bbox": [
            70,
            258,
            925,
            777
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": ">",
        "bbox": [
            65,
