        "bbox": [
            916,
            962,
            930,
            978
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "The shockwaves have already rippled through the world economy",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            85,
            356,
            898,
            704
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "page_number",
        "text": "6",
        "bbox": [
            917,
            963,
            929,
            978
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/1e0eee8e3f77d8136902aa9f421ec2433e80b2d762875514b8e23f2c81c6be98.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            730,
            212,
            769,
            248
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Past input price shocks remain a risk to future food security.",
        "text_level": 1,
        "bbox": [
            157,
            62,
            889,
            153
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/8bb27b83816438dd4fa2d99c516eab843ef1a4cd59e26a37e0f56f77d832c4b5.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            64,
            64,
            143,
            146
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/e8b59c474e8ef239073e9ac591c7235bb1611f589f3b6e61e81e3380d83a847a.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            260,
            164,
            300,
            198
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Traffic\nthrough the\nStrait of Hormuz\nwas\ndisrupted",
        "bbox": [
            62,
            325,
            256,
            467
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Food production may be affected, pushing domestic food prices further up.",
        "bbox": [
            61,
            738,
            254,
            876
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "limiting the availability and\nraising the cost of oil, gas and\nnitrogenous fertilizers.",
        "bbox": [
            260,
            202,
            582,
            287
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/3dceffc029ea783cfffb6c0746eac3294da0ac744c1c5282e8bdda372960b79d.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            64,
            285,
            902,
            895
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Vulnerable populations may face greater food insecurity and hunger.",
        "bbox": [
            388,
            594,
            628,
            708
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Higher energy\nprices increase\ntransport costs",
        "bbox": [
            728,
            252,
            895,
            341
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "and further\nfuel inflation,\nslowing\ndown the\nglobal\neconomy.",
        "bbox": [
            836,
            488,
            976,
            654
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Agricultural\nproduction costs\nincrease.",
        "bbox": [
            732,
            811,
            918,
            892
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "Source: UN Trade and Development (UNCTAD)",
        "bbox": [
            63,
            911,
            447,
            936
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "page_number",
        "text": "7",
        "bbox": [
            916,
            962,
            929,
            978
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Most vulnerable economies are exposed to oil and food price shocks.",
        "text_level": 1,
        "bbox": [
            158,
            63,
            896,
            154
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Number of economies that are net importers of oil or cereal products",
        "bbox": [
            63,
            171,
            925,
            203
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Least developed countries (LDCs)",
        "bbox": [
            66,
            218,
            331,
            245
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Small island developing States (SIDS)",
        "bbox": [
            365,
            218,
            632,
            244
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
