            "Notes: Seven LDCs with dual exposure, which are also SIDS, feature in the LDCs aggregate. Products referring to “petroleum, petroleum products and related materials” and “cereals and cereal preparations” of the Standard International Trade Classification (SITC 04 and 33)."
        ],
        "bbox": [
            72,
            293,
            961,
            802
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": ">",
        "bbox": [
            65,
