            145
        ],
        "page_idx": 13
    },
    {
        "type": "page_number",
        "text": "14",
        "bbox": [
            913,
            962,
            934,
            978
        ],
        "page_idx": 13
    },
    {
        "type": "chart",
        "img_path": "images/4e123410e801fa0b06363555900c0722323e28ca50316afcebc128e7b0e76962.jpg",
        "content": "",
        "chart_caption": [],
        "chart_footnote": [],
        "bbox": [
            686,
            262,
            929,
            828
        ],
        "page_idx": 14
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Short periods of unaffordable food can have lasting consequences.",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            157,
            62,
            920,
            154
        ],
        "page_idx": 14
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Increased risk of child wasting associated with a real food price increase of 5%",
        "bbox": [
            62,
            169,
            859,
            237
        ],
        "page_idx": 14
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Child wasting means that a child has low weight-for-height. It is a measure of acute malnutrition with a strong link to early childhood mortality.",
        "bbox": [
            105,
            305,
            714,
            413
        ],
        "page_idx": 14
    },
