    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Issues for consideration",
        "text_level": 1,
        "bbox": [
            161,
            82,
            636,
            122
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/373ff09304b24143362d3c6e37ec46761c21be18050542f9818cc8c262c006f9.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            82,
            184,
            142,
            243
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Normalization of trade will take time.",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            158,
            202,
            587,
            229
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "International energy prices can adjust fast, but shipping and value chains need time to adapt.",
        "bbox": [
            157,
            236,
            843,
            297
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/d55cff7c5e743a837c362063b7fcddbfc9ea0645af9a006253399c659bd16958.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            82,
            320,
            142,
            380
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "The impact of the energy shock will continue to be felt unevenly. Many vulnerable economies have limited ability to cope with soaring import bills. Countries dependent on oil imports face particularly strong domestic inflationary pressure.",
        "bbox": [
            155,
            336,
            900,
            465
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/f5783015f6466ca188b66623e161e365fb5bc316b0afdc218cbadddc837231bf.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            82,
            488,
            141,
            546
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Food production risks remain.",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            157,
            502,
            509,
            530
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Input price hikes that may have persistent impacts on production and trade, coupled with an expected strong El Niño, increase concerns about food insecurity.",
        "bbox": [
            156,
            536,
            881,
            631
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/564114fac8b938da7d613a56d4ec59916cd6718aa9820b31a250f4ef12bf032b.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            82,
            654,
            141,
            714
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "International support is needed.",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            158,
            668,
            530,
            696
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Decreasing official development assistance and mounting debt servicing burdens risk slowing down recovery.",
        "bbox": [
            157,
            702,
            909,
            765
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/e7df1c2402490efb67c157414a343a08ad638a7f91af3be852afbe36709eefdd.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            82,
            791,
            142,
            851
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Investment in resilience is key.",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            158,
            802,
            514,
            830
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "This includes diversification of trade sources, as well as other domestic resilience measures, conditional on financial constraints.",
        "bbox": [
            156,
            836,
            897,
            900
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "page_number",
        "text": "16",
        "bbox": [
            914,
            963,
            934,
            978
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "\"These shocks will be felt for many months – with developing countries bearing the heaviest impacts.",
        "bbox": [
            166,
            252,
            834,
            395
        ],
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "I call on all parties to honour the ceasefire and redouble efforts.”",
        "bbox": [
            166,
            440,
            773,
            532
        ],
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "António Guterres",
        "bbox": [
